                         RESP(WS-RESP)
               END-EXEC.
               EVALUATE WS-RESP
                  WHEN DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                       MOVE '00' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
                  WHEN DFHRESP(NOTFND)
                       MOVE '01' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
                  WHEN DFHRESP(DUPREC)
                       MOVE '02' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
                  WHEN OTHER
                       MOVE '90' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
